.TH CLIENT 1 "2026-09-25" "libmyutils 1.0" "libmyutils Manual"
.SH NAME
client \- driver program exercising the libmyutils string and file functions
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B client
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B client
is the test driver program for
.BR libmyutils .
It calls each of the string functions
.RB ( mystrlen ", " mystrcpy ", " mystrncpy ", " mystrcat )
and each of the file functions
.RB ( wordCount ", " mygrep )
with sample input, printing the result of each call to standard
output. It creates a temporary file to demonstrate the file
functions and removes it before exiting.
.SH EXIT STATUS
Returns 0 on success, or 1 if the temporary test file could not be
created or opened.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mystrlen (3),
.BR mystrcpy (3),
.BR mystrncpy (3),
.BR mystrcat (3),
.BR wordCount (3),
.BR mygrep (3)
